%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S12_8
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: No, I have to hold on for Scarlet.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I open my eyes again, expecting to see Scarlet running away from Amon.
      But instead, I see her on the floor with Amon's sword pierced through her stomach.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 21
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel my pulse rising and my mind going numb.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What? What am I seeing right now?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see Amon towering over her with a triumphant smile on his face.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I hate when things don't go my way. That's why I had to punish you, my
      dear Scarlet.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c4b2a190f3e4d5c6b7a8190a1b2c3d4, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet gasps for air.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You! I won't.. obey you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 19
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I almost buckle from my wobbly knees but I lunge at the Prince.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I have to get him away from her!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: As soon as I reach him, he disappears into thin air.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't know where I shifted him to, but I've got other things to worry
      about.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "{playerName}? I'm\u2026 sorry. I concentrated\u2026 so much\u2026 on not\u2026
      killing him again\u2026 but he got me with\u2026 his silver sword instead."
    alternativeText: "I'm\u2026 sorry. I concentrated\u2026 so much\u2026 on not\u2026
      killing him again\u2026 but he got me with\u2026 his silver sword instead."
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 21
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see the same Scars that she has on her Face in the Present as well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I couldn't protect her.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I finally sink down and sit beside her.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel frustrated and angry at myself.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Don't talk anymore Scarlet. Focus on breathing and staying conscious.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: How do I deal with this now? I need to help her.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't want you to die, Scarlet.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel warm tears running down my face.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm sorry that I was such a useless fool. I couldn't protect you at all.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She smiles at me weakly.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I want to tell you that every thing is fine, but to be honest\u2026 I
      feel like I might faint any second."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Her voice is very quiet and I can hear that she's straining herself just
      to stay conscious.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "You lost a lot of blood\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's right! she needs blood! We gotta get back as fast as possible.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "You're right\u2026 I might\u2026 need some blood\u2026 so I can recover."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I understand.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I take her into my arms carefully, trying not to make her wounds bleed
      any more.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet's brow furrows in confusion.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What are you doing?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 22
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I bend down and position her head closer to my neck.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Go ahead and drink.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Her eyes widen as she finally understands my intentions.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, let's just shift back. There are more than enough blood packs in the
      hideout.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 19
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 70a7a049a9d73584984badc2185da3c5, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0e2a2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e7e, type: 2}
